# Reverb, noise and pitch-modulation checks for test_sound.py's effects fixture; timings are vblanks at 60 Hz.
# Waits at the title until its song has started, stops it and waits 5 s for its reverb to die away, then runs the 9.8 s effects sequence.
wait state 2
wait 600
musicoff
wait 300
effects
wait 660
